{"title":"Plastic Spiders","slug":"Plastic_Spiders","pageid":4472,"revid":19829,"timestamp":"2025-10-05T17:35:08Z","lastEditor":"Aqua.atlas","categories":["Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.39.0"},{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater Island"},{"label":"optional Title","value":"Plastic Spider"},{"label":"Price","value":"3,199 Candy"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Monstrous Manor"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i><big>\"Yuck! Who puts a spider in a box?\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Also known as <b>Boxed Spider</b>, The <b>Plastic spider</b> is an item that can be found by killing <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spiders/\">spiders</a> on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spider_Tree/\">Spider trees</a>, or bought at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">Monstrous Manor</a> for 3,199 candy. \n</p><p>This item cannot be sold.\n</p>\n\n</div>"}
